---
---
<section class="workflow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="gradient-text">Nuestra Metodología</span>
      <h2>Proceso de Trabajo</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-line"></div>
      
      <div class="timeline-items">
        <div class="timeline-item reveal">
          <div class="point-glow"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="step-number">01</span>
            <h3>Descubrimiento</h3>
            <p>Reunión estratégica para entender tu idea, objetivos y necesidades específicas del mercado.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item reveal">
          <div class="point-glow"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="step-number">02</span>
            <h3>Diseño & Prototipado</h3>
            <p>Creamos interfaces UI/UX a medida en Figma, enfocadas en la conversión y experiencia de usuario.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item reveal">
          <div class="point-glow"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="step-number">03</span>
            <h3>Desarrollo</h3>
            <p>Programación robusta utilizando tecnologías modernas como Astro, React y bases de datos seguras.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item reveal">
          <div class="point-glow"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="step-number">04</span>
            <h3>Despliegue & Optimización</h3>
            <p>Lanzamiento oficial, pruebas de rendimiento y optimización SEO para garantizar el éxito.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .workflow {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .timeline-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, 
      transparent, 
      rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3) 10%, 
      rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3) 90%, 
      transparent
    );
  }

  .timeline-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    width: 50%;
    padding: 0 3rem;
  }

  .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
    align-self: flex-start;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
    align-self: flex-end;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .point-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 4rem;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--primary-glow);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .point-glow {
    right: -8px;
  }

  .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .point-glow {
    left: -8px;
  }

  .step-number {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    opacity: 0.1;
    color: white;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .timeline-line {
      left: 20px;
    }
    .timeline-item {
      width: 100%;
      padding-left: 50px;
      padding-right: 0;
      text-align: left !important;
    }
    .timeline-item .point-glow {
      left: 12px !important;
      top: 3.2rem;
    }
    .step-number {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
